@startuml roadmap_map
' Spectracs — Roadmap big-picture map: the PRODUCT VALUE CHAIN — the path one measurement travels
' (Setup -> Capture -> Process -> Evaluate -> Report -> Publish -> Bill) — over a platform/foundation
' layer, each stage shaded by how complete the REAL end-user path is. Companion to ROADMAP.md (the prose
' backlog). The point it surfaces: the pipeline is green end-to-end on the virtual device (and on the
' bench for real hardware). The real END-USER CAPTURE gap is now CLOSED — the wizard does real capture via the
' shared CapturePanel (M3, 2026-07-13, rig-verified). Remaining frontier: P5 real-oil verdict calibration.
' Regenerate:  java -jar plantuml.jar -tsvg roadmap_map.puml

title Spectracs — Roadmap map\nthe measurement value-chain over the platform, shaded by real-path completeness — 2026-07-19

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Sans
skinparam ArrowColor #5A7D8C
skinparam ArrowFontColor #5A7D8C
skinparam rectangle {
  FontColor #222222
  BorderColor #5A5A5A
  roundCorner 12
}

legend right
  |= colour |= meaning |
  | <#C8E6C9>    | shipped (real path) |
  | <#FFE0B2>    | next / the active frontier |
  | <#ECEFF1>    | later (blocked / not yet) |
  | <#E1BEE7>    | deferred design thread |
endlegend

' =================== the active frontier (what to actually do next) ===================
rectangle "★ FRONTIER — the real next moves (unblocked)" as FR #FFF3E0 {
  rectangle "**1. Capture-panel convergence** ✅ DONE (M3, 2026-07-13)\nACQUISITION runs through the shared CapturePanel in\nBOTH hosts; guidance deduped; bench -~460 net lines" as FR1 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**2. SM3 — real measurement in the WIZARD** ✅ DONE (M3, rig-verified)\nlive-burst -> graph on a real device via the shared\nCapturePanel + the engine frame-provider seam" as FR2 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**3. P5 — calibrate the verdict on real oils**\nsave metrics + known good/bad oils -> quant->qual\nbounds -> real peak-ratio edges (no thresholds ship first)" as FR3 #FFE0B2
}

' =================== the product value chain (a measurement's journey) ===================
rectangle "THE MEASUREMENT VALUE CHAIN  (a single measurement, left -> right)" as VC #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**1 · SETUP & CONNECT**\n✅ serial-keyed: master SpectrometerSetup\n(serial -> device + calibration + plugin),\nend-user register-by-serial -> auto-login.\nVirtual + real calibration (ELP) done.\n(real USB connect '5b' = design)" as S1 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**2 · CAPTURE** ✅\n✅ virtual device (engine)  ✅ bench real capture\n✅ WIZARD real capture (M3 — shared CapturePanel +\nengine frame-provider seam; rig-verified)" as S2 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**3 · PROCESS**\n✅ Mean -> Transmission (T=S/R) -> Absorption\n(A = -log10 S/R); plugin-declared plots\n(ref/sample overlay, T, A)" as S3 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**4 · EVALUATE**\n✅ peak-ratio render (greenness/pigment/browning/\nclarity, provisional) ✅ perceived-colour swatch\n▶ P5 calibrate -> real edges   (later: P6 pumpkin\nplugin adopts peak-ratio)" as S4 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**5 · REPORT**\n✅ plugin-driven PDF (M2): matplotlib visitor,\npreview = PDF, isShownInReport curates,\nwhole-Workflow JSON + capture PNGs embedded" as S5 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**6 · PUBLISH (LIMS)**\n✅ M1: PUBLISHING phase + 'Send to LIMS' ->\nSENAITE Sample + PDF attach, all via server API\n(later: numeric results push + state machine)" as S6 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**7 · BILL**\n✅ PayPal M1: one-off €1 sandbox end-to-end\n(Transaction + Orders v2 + Account settings)\n(later: €200/mo recurring; licence gate)" as S7 #C8E6C9
}

' =================== the end-user host the chain runs through ===================
rectangle "END-USER WORKFLOW & CAPTURE  (the host the chain runs through)" as EW #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**#6 pumpkin-oil workflow + plugin** ✅\nplugin_sdk + PumpkinOilPlugin + engine +\ninteractive nested wizard (Measure, plots, verdict);\nincl. **#6a** absorption display (PROCESSING)" as R6 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**Acquisition guidance (both hosts)** ✅ NEW 2026-07-13\ncoach line (plugin CaptureView.prompt) + amber\nnext-action cue; wizard + bench (logic mirrored ->\ndeduped by the capture-panel convergence)" as GUIDE #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**SM1 — Capture-images dev view** ✅ (RC-R0/R1)\nVID:PID->cv2 resolver + CaptureBackend (no MJPG) +\nsave-PNG + per-camera exposure + OUR auto-exposure" as SM1 #C8E6C9
}

' =================== platform + foundations that carry the chain ===================
rectangle "PLUGIN PLATFORM  (one declaration, many hosts/targets)" as PP #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**M1 convergence** ✅\nrender visitor + WorkflowPhaseRenderer\n(steps->tabs); view-model vocab; two hosts" as PM1 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**M2 PDF target** ✅\nMatplotlibWorkflowRenderer = 2nd visitor;\ngeneric per-view-model toJson/fromJson" as PM2 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**Capture-panel convergence** ✅ (M3)\nACQUISITION routes through the shared CapturePanel\n(both hosts); guidance collapsed" as PM6 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**M3 distribution** ✅ (A1·A2 + B0–B6 + A3, 2026-07-18/19)\nDB-stored SIGNED plugin source, client-side load;\n(codeRef,version) identity; Ed25519 sign/verify;\nPluginRegistry sealedness dispatch; publish/assign UI;\nA3 run provenance stamp. Later: B7 android · B8 batch" as PM3 #C8E6C9
}

rectangle "FOUNDATIONS  (proven earlier)" as FO #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "#1 spectrum->colour ✅ · #2 login header ✅\nmeasurement & evaluation CONCEPT ✅\n(T=S/R, colour under D65, hue verdict)" as FO1 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "Pipeline Playground PoC ✅\n(LED-synth ref + oil + absorption + colour +\nverdict; CFL calibration; regression test)" as FO2 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "#4 User CRUD ✅ · #5 three picture sets ✅\n(virtual device: 3 role slots + SPD->ROI\nencoder + round-trip)" as FO3 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**Schema migrations (Alembic)** ✅\nboth DB trees, guarded init, boot auto-apply;\nAllEntities completeness GUARD test (§8)\nso a new entity can't silently break autogen" as FO4 #C8E6C9
}

rectangle "ENABLEMENT" as EN #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**Doc Director harness — M1** ✅\n--doc-mode hint panel + UDP protocol +\nPyAutoGUI Director + scenarios (pumpkin\nwizard = M1). Bench video pending a rig" as EN1 #C8E6C9
  rectangle "**Doc M2** (later)\nvirtual feature tour + real USB connect\nscreencast; scenario picker; fallbacks" as EN2 #ECEFF1
}

rectangle "CROSS-CUTTING  (deferred design threads)" as CC #FFFFFF {
  rectangle "**workflow-record persistence**\ndesign only (SPEC_workflow_persistence.md):\nDbMeasurement JSON-blob record + saved-runs list/detail;\nprereq for Save in #3 / #6" as CCa #E1BEE7
  rectangle "**Android port**\ndesign only (SPEC_android_port.md):\nreal-scipy-in-app, two APKs, buildozer+p4a, spike gate" as CCand #E1BEE7
  rectangle "PDF report + email\n(PDF done via M2; email transport deferred)" as CCc #E1BEE7
  rectangle "LED-combination optimisation\n(future: search a flatter reference)" as CCd #E1BEE7
  rectangle "pumpkin authenticity / adulteration check\n(later plugin-side evaluation feature)" as CCauth #E1BEE7
  rectangle "**test-suite hygiene debt**\nbacklog (non-blocking) — 3 pre-existing test\nfailures (T1 stale calib-DB fixture, T2 modal-dialog\nhang blocks the suite, T3 stale nav-glyph)\nSPEC_test_hygiene_debt.md" as CCe #E1BEE7
  rectangle "**LIMS-side Plone add-on**\ndeferred (separate repo, Plone/Py2.7):\nparse embedded workflow.json + render absorption\non demand inside SENAITE" as LIMS2 #E1BEE7
}

' =================== the goal ===================
rectangle "★ MILESTONE — real end-to-end after user setup\nmaster sets up a serial unit -> end user registers by serial ->\nREAL measurement + evaluation (no virtual device).\n**Frontier #1 + SM3 shipped (M3) — reachable now;**\nremaining: P5 real-oil verdict calibration + full-chain run." as GOAL #FFE0B2

' ---- value chain flow ----
S1 -right-> S2
S2 -right-> S3
S3 -right-> S4
S4 -right-> S5
S5 -right-> S6
S6 -right-> S7

' ---- platform carries the chain ----
PM1 --> S3 : declares process/eval views
PM1 --> S4
PM2 --> S5 : PDF is a 2nd render target
PM1 --> S6 : plugin PUBLISHING step
PM6 --> S2 : shared capture seam UNBLOCKS wizard
PM1 --> PM6
PM1 --> PM2
PM1 --> PM3

' ---- the end-user host runs the chain ----
R6 --> S2 : the wizard runs the chain
GUIDE ..> S2 : guides ACQUISITION
SM1 --> S2 : real-capture foundation
S6 ..> LIMS2 : same embedded PDF, LIMS-side viewer

' ---- foundations support ----
FO1 --> S3
FO2 --> S4 : pipeline proven
FO3 --> S1 : users + virtual device
FO3 --> S7 : AppUser -> Transaction
FO4 --> PM3 : (codeRef,version) + provenance migrations

' ---- frontier -> goal ----
FR1 --> FR2
FR2 --> GOAL
S1 --> GOAL : setup half (done)

' ---- enablement demonstrates the chain ----
S2 ..> EN1 : the wizard run is the M1 scenario
EN1 --> EN2

@enduml
